tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705800/extras/d3e27e6a30fa44679e0ad64912c44602.webm?t=1736334176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2705800/extras/d3e27e6a30fa44679e0ad64912c44602.mp4?t=1736334176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Can you break the cycle, defeat the undead king, and ensure a triumphant end to your campaign? Explore the intricate blend of time travel and tabletop RPG in Time Glitch \u2013 where the past is your greatest weapon.",
